eric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;mugihe ugize igicuruzwa (product) ushima uyikandaho, mugihe ije ubasha kwemeza bimwe mubigize icyo gicuruzwa( product) mubyo waba wifuza nk’ ibara (color) cyangwa nimero(size) ndetse ukanemeza umubare w’ ibicuruzwa ucyeneye (Quantity).&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: 624px; height: 321px\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/qFExc2rPuGSCNP0SNf8lVOIts_XD1IXm2mW33ZWURRQT_ozb5DXRwZvOnYk5SVS5Gcq66zejJX_c1d-UyG8W7UyS9H3SGY-4Qs0d7plrsnmTfYkTarfV2-NYRskLlQ\" width=\"624\" height=\"321\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"></span></span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mbere yo kwemeza kugura ubanza kureba niba iyo product uhisemo ihari cyangwa itagihari (in stock or out of stock) iyo umaze kubonako ihari ukanda kuri add to cart mugihe wifuza kuyishyira kuri list yibyo wifuza kugura ugasa nkuba ayibitse kugirango uze kuba wakongeraho ibindi bicuruzwa (products) ngo ugurire rimwe utarinze wakora orders nyinshi.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: 624px; height: 340px\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/IVDZ9hoyRaJxQH3xqXfEQg_L4V1c7iaSkIlFsHKV2OCRwZ7LV3zpHCfWooq3GdQDtGiVAnMs2YnHCeRuXrUjUisfYUxkDQEnc8y6eDor106Rl6Fv8gOefHiJ68oIoA\" width=\"624\" height=\"340\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">hanyuma iyo ucyeneye kureba ibyo wahisemo kugura ujya hejuru ahanditse cart ukabona ibyo wabitse.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: 624px; height: 324px\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/g_gelYOwr_jcLS2Y5oFaq94RhYzr7bEy9Qhnl1oIFSktxha_DoZbCT4BxApBgshA6RkxnvhtYtpyOoDwdeuYrp9eRqrhZEWhwKlTeUhcPFH-3XDbuoDhl7x_2Cbedg\" width=\"624\" height=\"324\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\"></span></span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.3800000000000001;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;hanyuma ugakanda kuri check out bagahita bakwereka ibicuruzwa wemeje kugura hasiyibyo bicuruzwa hari ahanditse billing details aho wuzurizamo inyiron