m;\r\n	line-height:115%;\r\n	mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",\"sans-serif\";\r\n	mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n	mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]-->\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">Kuva\r\ntariki ya 12/01/2020 Amezi atagera kuri 3 arashize coronavirus ibarizwa\r\nmugihugu cy’Ubushinwa gusa nta kindi gihugu irageramo ku isi yose nyuma kuri\r\ntariki ya 13/01/2020 nibwo haje kugaragara umuntu wambere wanduye iyi ndwara\r\nmugihugu cya Thailand abandi bagaragara mu Buyapani na Koreya y\'Epfo, Leta\r\nZunze Ubumwe za Amerika nayo iza gukurikiraho,ikomeza ikwirakwira ku isi yose\r\ngahoro gahoro kugeza aho abarenga miliyoni na Magana ibiri bamaze kuyandura\r\nabandi barenga ibihumbi mirongo itandatu na birindwi bamaze kwitaba imana\r\nbazize iki cyorezo cya coronavirus.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Hagati\r\naho,n’ubwo iki cyorezo kimaze igihe kandi abarwayi bakaba bakomeza kwiyongera\r\nku rwego rwo hejuru, hari ibihugu bimwe bitaragerwaho n’iki cyorezo cya\r\ncoronavirus. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Amakuru\r\ndukesha kaminuza ya Johns Hopkins atangaza ko kuri tariki ya 02 z\'uku kwa kane,\r\nmu bihugu 193 bigize ishyirahamwe rya ONU, 18 muri ibyo hataragaragara umuntu\r\nwanduye coronavirus.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Ibyo bihugu bitaragaragaraho umuntu\r\nwanduye coronavirus ni:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">1.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Ibirwa bya Komore</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Kiribati</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Lesotho</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Ibirwa bya Marshall</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">5.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Micronesia</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">6.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Nauru</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">7.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Korea ya Ruguru</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">8.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Palau</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">9.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Samoa</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">10.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Sao\r\nTome et Principe</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">11.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Ibirwa\r\nbya Solomon</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">12.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Sudani\r\ny\'Epfo</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">13.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Tajikistan</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">14.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Tonga</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">15.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Turkmenistan</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">16.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Tuvalu</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">17.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Vanuatu\r\nna </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormalCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:\r\nauto;mso-add-space:auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";=\"\" mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">18.</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n7.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:=\"\" \"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Yemen.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Nubwo\r\nkugeza ubu ibi bihugu byemeza ko ntabantu banduye baragaragara, abahanga bemeza\r\nko hashobora kuba hari ibihugu bimwe muri ibi twavuze haruguru byaba bifite\r\nabantu banduye coronavirus ariko bakaba batamenyekana ko bayanduye, aha batunga\r\nagatoki igihugu cya <b>Koreya ya Ruguru</b> hamwe n’igihugu cya <b>Yemen</b>\r\ncyazahajwe n’intambara.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Ikindi\r\ncyagaragaye nuko muri biriya bihugu coronavirus itarageramo byinshi muribyo ari\r\nibirwa bito bidakunda kugendwa cyane, kuko mu bihugu 10 bya mbere bigendwa\r\nn’abantu bake kwisi nk’uko ONU ibigaragaza 7 muri byo<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp; </span>nta coronavirus irahagaragara.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Benshi\r\nbakeka ko kuba ibyo birwa biri kure cyane y’ibindi bihugu kandi bikaba\r\nbidakunda kugendwa n’abantu baturutse mubindi bihugu bitandukanye, bibiha\r\namahirwe yo kuba bitagerwaho n’icyorezo cya coronavirus.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Nauru,\r\nikirwa giherereye mu Nyanja ya Pasific kikaba kiri ku birometero 320 uvuye\r\nkumupaka w’igihugu kiri hafi yacyo&nbsp; akaba ari ibindi birwa bya Kiribati.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Nicyo\r\ngihugu cya kabiri gito kw’isi kiri mu ishyirahamwe rya ONU (nyuma ya\r\nMonaco),kikaba gifite abantu barenga gato ibihumbi 10.000 kikaba na none ari\r\nicya kabiri mubihugu bifite abaturage bake ku isi (nyuma ya Tuvalu).</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Nubwo ari\r\nigihugu gito kandi kigendwa nabantu bake, ntibikibujije kuba gihangayikishijwe\r\ncyane na coronavirus kuko gifite ibitaro bimwe gusa kandi nabyo bidafite\r\nibikoresho bihagije mu gupima cyangwa guhangana na coronavirus aho iyo hafashwe\r\nibipimo kubarwayi,byoherezwa muri Australia kugira babashe gusuzuma.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n\" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",\"serif\";mso-fareast-font-family:\"times=\"\" roman\"\"=\"\">Ikiganiro\r\numukuru w’igihugu yagiranye n’umunyamakuru wa BBC yatangaje ko kugira igihugu\r\nayobora kigeze ikigihe hatagararagara ubwandu bwa COVID-19 aruko yahise afata\r\ningamba zikomeye zirimo guhagarika ingendo zihuza icyo gihugu nibindi byose.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>', '1586121694VI.JPG', 'BBC', 1098, 1, NULL, NULL, 'Muhahe.com', '2020-04-05 19:21:34');
