 src=\"blob:https://www.muhahe.com/80eb17a3-f081-43b2-ac87-d30334bee96a\" width=\"1351\" />\r\n<figcaption></figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Hitamo hasi ahantu handitse<strong> &ldquo;Aho umucuruzi yiyandikishiriza&nbsp;(Signup)&rdquo;</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"blob:https://www.muhahe.com/9461043f-f908-4b6b-bef2-e63ec79a83b9\" width=\"1349\" />\r\n<figcaption></figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"blob:https://www.muhahe.com/2d146513-ae7c-4423-93f7-d4ef2100ae5f\" width=\"1349\" />\r\n<figcaption></figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"blob:https://www.muhahe.com/68d0864b-f554-4dde-a863-291931504b81\" width=\"1349\" />\r\n<figcaption></figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Uzuza neza umwirondoro wawe ubundi wemeze hasi ahanditse ngo<strong> &ldquo;Iyandikishe (Signup)&rdquo;</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">Kanda ahanditse<strong> &ldquo;Ubwinjiriro bw&rsquo;umucuruzi (Login)&rdquo; ubundi winjire</strong></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"blob:https://www.muhahe.com/9e3fd517-3545-4e9d-8506-11f97fc1d685\" width=\"1341\" />\r\n<figcaption></figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"blob:https://www.muhahe.com/fd0ee089-06ea-465a-8c5d-e2130efe3e87\" width=\"1341\" />\r\n<figcaption></figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">&nbsp;Baca umugani mu kinyarwanda uti&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;umukobwa wabuze umuranga yaheze iwabo&rdquo; </strong>tugane tugufashe kumenyekanisha ibikorwa byawe ku isi hose winjize mu buryo bwikubye inshuro utakekaga kuko sibikiri ngombwa ko ugira abaguzi bagusanga aho ukorera gusa mu gihe ukorana na muhahe Ltd.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">2. Umuguzi</span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://muhahe.com/blog/30\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:blue\">Nawe muguzi sitwakwibagiwe, kanda kuri link iri hasi ubone uburyo wabasha kwigurira icyo ushaka cyose tukakigusangisha aho uherereye, unirinda ingendo zitari ngombwa, wirinda kuba wakandura iki cyorezo kiri hanze aha cya coronavirus.</span></span></strong></a></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://muhahe.com/blog/30\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:blue\">Kanda hano</span></span></strong></a></span></span></p>', '1594021786mu.JPG', 'Muhahe.com', 2413, 1, 'kigali store,kigali online store,kigali shopping,kigali online shopping,buy and sell in kigali,kigali online delivery,kigali shop,muhahe ltd,igura n\'igurisha,e-commerce in rwanda,e-commerce in kigali,online shop,ihaha in kigali,iduka in kigali', '<p>Menya urubuga ruriguca ibintu muri Kigali mu guhuza byoroshye umucuruzi n&rsquo;umuguzi ndetse rugafasha abantu kugura no kugurisha ibicuruzwa kuri murandasi.&rdquo;</p>', 'muhahe Ltd', '2020-07-06 05:49:46'),
(74, 11, 'Menya Uburyo 6 utaruzi wakoresha urinda amaso yawe gutukura ahubwo Akaba umweru', '<p><em><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>Ni kenshi usanga abantu bamwe amaso atukuye cyane, nyamara kubandi ugasanga ni umweru. Tugiye kureba uburyo busanzwe umuntu yakoresha kugira amaso ye ahinduke umweru neza. ndetse n&#39;uwo atara tukura yakomeza kuyabungabunga&nbsp;</strong></span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>1. Ruhuka kureba TV no kureba muri mudasobwa</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Nubwo waba waryamye igihe kirekire bihagije, ariko ushobora gukomeza kuba ufite amaso atukuye kubera umara igihe kirekire uri kureba TV, cyangwa uri gukoresha mudasobwa. Ibi biterwa nuko abantu iyo bari kureba TV, cyangwa bari gukoresha mudasobwa bahumbya gace bishoboka. Ubushakashatsi bugaragaza ko byibura wagakwiye gufata 15 yo kuruhuka buri masaha 2 kandi ugafata akaruhuko k&rsquo;amasegonda 30 mu minota 15 mu gihe waba uri gukoresha mudasobwa cyangwa uri kureba TV. Mugihe uri gufata aka karuhuko, gerageza urebe ahantu kure urebeye nko mu idirishya cyangwa n&rsquo;ifoto iri ahitaruye mu cyumba uri gukoreramo.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>2. Kura imyanda yose mumaso kandi wirinde kubyiringira ijisho</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">N&#39;utuntu duto cyane, nk&rsquo;umukungugu, twagiye mumaso tuba dushobora kwangiza imitsi yo mumaso. Niba wumva utokowe gerageza&nbsp;ntubyiringire ijisho&nbsp;kuko ibi biba bishobora kwangiza agace k&rsquo;ijisho kitwa <strong>Cornea</strong>. Ahubwo, icyiza ni ukoza ijisho ryawe. Ijisho waryoza ushyira igitonyanga cy&rsquo;amazi mujisho ukanuye, mugihe kimaze kujyamo ugahumbaguza cyane kandi byihuse. Kugira kandi ribe ryacya neza cyane, ushobora gukoresha ikiganza ukarifungura mu gihe igitonyanga gitambukamo. Ushobora kandi no gukoresha amazi, ugakaraba bisanzwe mumaso ukoresheje amazi meza, kandi amaso afunguye. Ibi bituma amazi anyura mumaso akahoza, cyangwa, ushobora gukoresha n&rsquo;ibikoresho byabugenewe mukoza amaso. Mugihe mujisho harimo imyanda, bishobora kuguteza ikibazo yaba guhumbya cyangwa gufungura amaso.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>3. Gerageza uryame n&#39;ibura&nbsp;amasaha umunani buri joro</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Kutabona igihe gihagije cyo&nbsp;gusinzira ni kimwe mubituma amaso atukura cyane. Niba wumva unaniwe, waguye gerageza ushake umwanya wo kuruhuka,niba ubona uhorana&nbsp;amaso atukuye bishobokako byatewe n&#39;uko utasinziriye bihagije. Abantu bakuru bisaba ko baryama amasaha hagati y&rsquo;arindwi n&rsquo;icyenda buri joro, gusa kuri bamwe bibwira ko amasaha ari munsi yayo ashobora kuba ahagije kuri bo bitewe n&rsquo;imiterere y&rsquo;akazi kabo cyangwa n&#39;uko bimenyereje, gusa ibi byangiza amaso yabo.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>4. Ambara amadarubindi Mugihe ugenda hari izuba (sunglasses)</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ubushakashatsi buvugako kuba uri kuzuba igihe kirekire cyangwa mu muyaga bishobora gutuma amaso atukura. Mugihe waba wambaye RayBan mu kurinda ko amaso yakira urumuri rukabije, mugihe uri hanze, byagufasha kurinda amaso kuba yakubitwa n&rsquo;umuyaga cyangwa yagirwaho na UV light zishobora kuyananiza. Kwambara sunglasses ni ingenzi mu kwirinda ko amaso atukura. Urumuri rwinshi rw&rsquo;izuba rushobora guteza ibibazo ku mikorere y&rsquo;ijisho, bikaba byatuma ritukura cyane.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>5. Reka Kunywa itabi kandi wirinde kuba ahantu hari imyotsi yaryo</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Kunywa itabi ni kimwe m&#39;ubintu bitera ugutukura kw&rsquo;amaso. Niba unywa itabi, geregeza bishoboka kurireka kandi wirinde&nbsp;ahantu hari imyotsi yaryo &ndash; aho bari kurinywera, niba&nbsp; wari ufite gahunda yo kurinywa waba ubiretse kuko ryatera amaso yawe gutukura bikabije. Uretse kuba byagufasha kurinda amaso yawe gutukura, kuva ku itabi bifitiye umubiri ibyiza byinshi cyane.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>6. Nt&#39;ugakoreshe bikabije imiti yo kwa muganga yo guhindura amaso imyeru</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Iyi miti ifatwa nk&#39;uburyo bwihuse bwagufasha guhinduka amaso yawe&nbsp;umweru m&#39;ugihe gito, gusa kuyikoresha bishobora gutuma ikibazo gikomera kurusha kucyoroshya. Iyi miti ikoreshwa iba irimo <strong>Vasocontrictors </strong>&ndash; bikaba bimwe mu byegeranya udutsi dutwara amaraso mumaso. Iyo uyikoresheje cyane, umubiri wubaka uburyo bwo kujya urwanya iyo miti, ibi bigatuma amaso aba imituku cyane birenze. Mugihe ugiye kugura iyi miti mu kugufasha guhindura amaso imyeru, ugomba kwirinda iyaba ifite bimwe muri ibi bikurikira: Ephedrine hydrochloride, Naphazoline hydrochloride, Phenylephrine hydrochloride na Tetrahydrozoline hydrochloride.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1594211343Common-Myths-About-Pink-Eye-722x406.jpg', 'ubuzima', 1607, 1, 'muhahe shop,online shopping,kigali shopping,ihaha,igura,kigali online store,kigali marketing,delivery', '<p>Menya Uburyo utaruzi wakoresha urinda amaso yawe gutukura ahubwo Akaba umweru</p>', NULL, '2020-07-08 10:29:03');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `category_id`, `title`, `details`, `photo`, `source`, `views`, `status`, `meta_tag`, `meta_description`, `tags`, `created_at`) VALUES
(75, 9, 'Umutoza \"Thierry Henry\" yashyize atangaza icyamuteye gupfukama iminota igera ku 8:46 mbere y\'uko umukino utangira', '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Icyamamare muri ruhago ndetse akaba n&#39;umutoza w&#39;ikipe ya Montreal Impact yafashe umwanzuro apfukama iminota&nbsp;8:46 mbere y&#39;umukino wo gusubukura shampiyona ya Major League Soccer(MLS) mu rwego rwo kwibuka George Floyd.</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Nyuma y&#39;umukino bamubajije icyabimuteye ntiyazuyaje abasubiza ati: <em><strong>&quot;Ndibaza ko muzi impamvu, byari ukubahiriza no gushyigikira iyo mpamvu. Ntakindi</strong></em>&quot;.Umwanya yamaze ungana n&#39;igihe umupolisi Derek Chauvin yamaze ashinze ivi kuri George Floyd, umwirabura utari witwaje intwaro, bikamuviramo gupfa. n&#39;ubwo abashinjacyaha bo muri leta ya Minnesota bavuze ko nyuma y&#39;iperereza basanze uriya mupolisi yarashinze ivi kuri Bwana Floyd mu gihe cy&#39;iminota 7:46 aho kuba 8:46.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Uyu&nbsp; rutahizamu ukomeye mu mateka ya ruhago kw&#39;isi kubera uburyo y&#39;itwaye igihe yakinaga muri&nbsp;Arsenal ndetse watwaye igikombe cy&#39;isi n&#39;ikipe y&#39;Ubufaransa, asanzwe azwiho kwamagana ibikorwa by&#39;ivangura rishingiye ku ruhu.Nyuma y&#39;umukino bakinnye n&#39;ikipe ya New England Revolution, yatangaje ko yibuka neza ko mu myaka yashize bamutukaga ari mu kibuga kubera ibara ry&#39;uruhu rwe.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"blob:https://muhahe.com/ec88050d-d1f4-4157-ac22-1160f31842d1\" width=\"750\" />\r\n<figcaption></figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ku mukino w&#39;ejo kuwa kane, Henry yari yambaye umupira wanditseho <strong>&quot;Black Lives Matter&quot;</strong>, akaba yarapfukamwe mu mwanya wagenewe abatoza ku kibuga mu rwego rwo gushyigikira iyo nkubiri.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">ku rukuta rwa twitter Major League Soccer (MLS) banditse bishimira iki gikorwa Thierry Henry yakoze murwego rwo gukomeza guharanira ko abirabura nabo bahabwa agaciro bagombwa.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<figure class=\"easyimage easyimage-full\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"blob:https://muhahe.com/2e24c450-716d-4c39-9805-4f3f092c4cbc\" width=\"620\" />\r\n<figcaption></figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '15943623440_SDC_MDG_Thierry-Henry_6080JPG.jpg', 'BBC', 1885, 1, 'muhahe shop,muhahe ecommerce,muhahe delivery,kigali free delivery,kigali shopping,kigali online shopping,kigali store,kigali buy and sell,kigali shop,ihaha,iduka,igura n\'igurisha,kuri make', '<p>Umutoza &quot;Thierry Henry&quot; yashyize atangaza icyamuteye gupfukama iminota igera ku 8:46 mbere y&#39;uko umukino utangira</p>', NULL, '2020-07-10 04:25:44'),
(76, 8, 'U Rwanda mu bihugu 15 byambere biyoboye ibindi mu ikoranabuhanga, Niki kiri gutuma u Rwanda rutumbagira cyane.', '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">U Rwanda ni kimwe mu bihugu by&rsquo;Afurika bikataje mu iterambere rishingiye ku ikoranabuhanga. Kuri ubu iyo uvuze ikoranabuhanga cyangwa tekinoroji ukibagirwa murandasi (internet) ntago interuro iba yuzuye, bisaba ko irijambo &ldquo;murandasi&rdquo; uritindaho kandi ukanariha agaciro mu mishinga yose waba ugiye gukora ifite aho ihurira na tekinoloji. </span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Reka turebere hamwe ibyiza by&rsquo;Ikoranabuhanga naho rimaze kugeza bimwe mu bihugu biri kumuvuduko wo hejuru mu kubyaza umusaruro ikoranabuhanga, uRwanda narwo urarusanga muri iki kegeranyo mugezwaho n&rsquo;urubuga <strong><em>MUHAHE.COM</em></strong>.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Urubuga <strong><em><a href=\"http://www.techeconomy.ng/\" style=\"font-family:\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"color:black\">www.techeconomy.ng</span></span></a> </em></strong>mu mwaka wa 2020 rwagaragaje neza ibihugu by&rsquo;Afurika biyoboye ibindi mu kugira ikoranabuhanga riteye imbere no guhanga udushya mu rwego rwo kuzamura ubukungu bwabyo. Mukegeranyo cyakozwe nuru rubuga kigaragaza ko ubushakashatsi cyabukoreye kubihugu birenga 130 ku Isi, aho harebwaga kubukungu bwabyo ndetse nibintu byagiye bigira uruhare kugirango ubwo bukungu buzamuke. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Mu mwanzuro w&rsquo;ubu bushakashatsi bwakozwe n&rsquo;uru rubuga ugaragaza ko guhanga udushya ndetse n&rsquo;imirimo ikorerwa kuri <strong><em>&ldquo;Murandasi&rdquo; </em></strong>aribyo biza imbere mukuzamura ubukungu bw&rsquo;ibi bihugu, aho usanga byinshi muri byo bikora cyane ubucuruzi bugezweho bukorerwa kuri murandasi. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Uru rutonde ruyobowe n&rsquo;Ibihugu bya Tanzania, Afurika y&rsquo;Epfo, Morocco, Kenya,Misiri, Senegal, Cabo verde,Ghana, Nigeria, Malawi, Namibia,Zimbabwe,Ehiopia, Rwanda, ibi nibyo bihugu bigaragara ko biri kumuvuduko wo hejuru kuruta ibindi mu kuzamura ubukungu bwabyo hitabwa mu guhanga udushya no kurema imirimo myinshi ishingiye kuri Murandasi.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Iyo ugarutse ku Rwanda runaboneka muri uru rutondo muri iyi minsi ya none usanga ruri korohereza abashoramari bashora mu mishinga ifite aho ihurira n&rsquo;ikoranabuhanga no guhanga udushya, bitewe nuko ariho hari amahirwe menshi yo kurandura burundu ikibazo cy&rsquo;ubushomeri murubyiruko.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Leta y&rsquo;uRwanda ishishikariza urubyiruko kubyaza amahirwe yo kuba bafite murandasi (internet) ihendutse ko bakwiye kubibonamo amahirwe akomeye yo kuba abashoramari mpuzamahanga kuko ariho bahurira n&rsquo;Isoko rinini bashobora gucururizaho, ubumenyi, ibicuruzwa ndetse n&rsquo;ibindi byinshi, cyangwa se bakanahabonera nandi mahirwe.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">U Rwanda ni kimwe mu bihugu by&rsquo;Afurika bikataje mu iterambere rishingiye ku ikoranabuhanga. Kuri ubu iyo uvuze ikoranabuhanga cyangwa tekinoroji ukibagirwa murandasi (internet) ntago interuro iba yuzuye, bisaba ko irijambo <strong>&ldquo;murandasi&rdquo;</strong> uritindaho kandi ukanariha agaciro mu mishanga yose waba ugiye gukora ifite aho ihurira na tekinoloji. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Reka turebere hamwe ibyiza by&rsquo;Ikoranabuhanga naho rimaze kugeza bimwe mu bihugu biri kumuvuduko wo hejuru mu kubyaza umusaruro ikoranabuhanga, uRwanda narwo urarusanga muri iki kegeranyo mugezwaho n&rsquo;urubuga <strong><em>MUHAHE.COM</em></strong>. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Urubuga <strong><em><a href=\"http://www.techeconomy.ng/\" style=\"font-family:\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"color:black\">www.techeconomy.ng</span></span></a> </em></strong>mu mwaka wa 2020 rwagaragaje neza ibihugu by&rsquo;Afurika biyoboye ibindi mu kugira ikoranabuhanga riteye imbere no guhanga udushya mu rwego rwo kuzamura ubukungu bwabyo. Mukegeranyo cyakozwe nuru rubuga kigaragaza ko ubushakashatsi cyabukoreye kubihugu birenga 130 ku Isi, aho harebwaga kubukungu bwabyo ndetse nibintu byagiye bigira uruhare kugirango ubwo bukungu buzamuke. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Mu mwanzuro w&rsquo;ubu bushakashatsi bwakozwe n&rsquo;uru rubuga ugaragaza ko guhanga udushya ndetse n&rsquo;imirimo ikorerwa kuri <strong><em>&ldquo;Murandasi&rdquo; </em></strong>aribyo biza imbere mukuzamura ubukungu bw&rsquo;ibi bihugu, aho usanga byinshi muri byo bikora cyane ubucuruzi bugezweho bukorerwa kuri murandasi. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Uru rutonde ruyobowe n&rsquo;Ibihugu bya Tanzania, Afurika y&rsquo;Epfo, Morocco, Kenya,Misiri, Senegal, Cabo verde,Ghana, Nigeria, Malawi, Namibia,Zimbabwe,Ehiopia, Rwanda, ibi nibyo bihugu bigaragara ko biri kumuvuduko wo hejuru kuruta ibindi mu kuzamura ubukungu bwabyo hitabwa mu guhanga udushya no kurema imirimo myinshi ishingiye kuri Murandasi.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Iyo ugarutse ku Rwanda runaboneka muri uru rutondo muri iyi minsi ya none usanga ruri korohereza abashoramari bashora mu mishinga ifite aho ihurira n&rsquo;ikoranabuhanga no guhanga udushya, bitewe nuko ariho hari amahirwe menshi yo kurandura burundu ikibazo cy&rsquo;ubushomeri murubyiruko.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Leta y&rsquo;uRwanda ishishikariza urubyiruko kubyaza amahirwe yo kuba bafite murandasi (internet) ihendutse ko bakwiye kubibonamo amahirwe akomeye yo kuba abashoramari mpuzamahanga kuko ariho bahurira n&rsquo;Isoko rinini bashobora gucururizaho, ubumenyi, ibicuruzwa ndetse n&rsquo;ibindi byinshi, cyangwa se bakanahabonera nandi mahirwe.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">U Rwanda ni kimwe mu bihugu by&rsquo;Afurika bikataje mu iterambere rishingiye ku ikoranabuhanga. Kuri ubu iyo uvuze ikoranabuhanga cyangwa tekinoroji ukibagirwa murandasi (internet) ntago interuro iba yuzuye, bisaba ko irijambo <strong>&ldquo;murandasi&rdquo;</strong> uritindaho kandi ukanariha agaciro mu mishanga yose waba ugiye gukora ifite aho ihurira na tekinoloji. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Reka turebere hamwe ibyiza by&rsquo;Ikoranabuhanga naho rimaze kugeza bimwe mu bihugu biri kumuvuduko wo hejuru mu kubyaza umusaruro ikoranabuhanga, uRwanda narwo urarusanga muri iki kegeranyo mugezwaho n&rsquo;urubuga <strong><em>MUHAHE.COM</em></strong>. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Urubuga <strong><em><a href=\"http://www.techeconomy.ng/\" style=\"font-family:\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"color:black\">www.techeconomy.ng</span></span></a> </em></strong>mu mwaka wa 2020 rwagaragaje neza ibihugu by&rsquo;Afurika biyoboye ibindi mu kugira ikoranabuhanga riteye imbere no guhanga udushya mu rwego rwo kuzamura ubukungu bwabyo. Mukegeranyo cyakozwe nuru rubuga kigaragaza ko ubushakashatsi cyabukoreye kubihugu birenga 130 ku Isi, aho harebwaga kubukungu bwabyo ndetse nibintu byagiye bigira uruhare kugirango ubwo bukungu buzamuke. </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Mu mwanzuro w&rsquo;ubu bushakashatsi bwakozwe n&rsquo;uru rubuga ugaragaza ko guhanga udushya ndetse n&rsquo;imirimo ikorerwa kuri <strong><em>&ldquo;Murandasi&rdquo; </em></strong>aribyo biza imbere mukuzamura ubukungu bw&rsquo;ibi bihugu, aho usanga byinshi muri byo bikora cyane ubucuruzi bugezweho bukorerwa kuri murandasi. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Uru rutonde ruyobowe n&rsquo;Ibihugu bya Tanzania, Afurika y&rsquo;Epfo, Morocco, Kenya,Misiri, Senegal, Cabo verde,Ghana, Nigeria, Malawi, Namibia,Zimbabwe,Ehiopia, Rwanda, ibi nibyo bihugu bigaragara ko biri kumuvuduko wo hejuru kuruta ibindi mu kuzamura ubukungu bwabyo hitabwa mu guhanga udushya no kurema imirimo myinshi ishingiye kuri Murandasi.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Iyo ugarutse ku Rwanda runaboneka muri uru rutondo muri iyi minsi ya none usanga ruri korohereza abashoramari bashora mu mishinga ifite aho ihurira n&rsquo;ikoranabuhanga no guhanga udushya, bitewe nuko ariho hari amahirwe menshi yo kurandura burundu ikibazo cy&rsquo;ubushomeri murubyiruko.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Leta y&rsquo;uRwanda ishishikariza urubyiruko kubyaza amahirwe yo kuba bafite murandasi (internet) ihendutse ko bakwiye kubibonamo amahirwe akomeye yo kuba abashoramari mpuzamahanga kuko ariho bahurira n&rsquo;Isoko rinini bashobora gucururizaho, ubumenyi, ibicuruzwa ndetse n&rsquo;ibindi byinshi, cyangwa se bakanahabonera nandi mahirwe.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1632062568blog c.jpg', 'Muhahe', 1172, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021-08-30 16:11:05'),
(78, 7, 'UBU NIBWO BURYO BWIZEWE, BWAZAGUHA AMAFARANGA  MU BURYO BURABYE, NIYO WABA USINZIRIYE CYANGWA URASHAKA GUKOMEZA KWIBERA UMUFANA, W\'ABAMAZE GUSHORA  MU IKORANABUHANGA?', '<p><strong>Ushobora kuba warigeze &nbsp;wifuza cyangwa&nbsp;&nbsp;ukibaza niba ubu byakorohera cyangwa&nbsp;niba &nbsp;byagushobokera kuba&nbsp;&nbsp;waba umwe mubanyamigabane bagize zimwe muri kampani(company) zikora ubucuruzi bwo kuri internet &nbsp;zagiye zigira benezo n&#39;abashoyemo imari&nbsp;&nbsp;bakaba aba billionaire, harimo nka za: &nbsp;google,amazon,Alibaba , apple n&#39;izindi zitandukanye, zose zishingiye ku ikorana buhanga.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;Ukuri nyako&nbsp;&nbsp;n&#39;uko ubu benshi&nbsp;&nbsp;babyifuza &nbsp;ariko ntibiborohere! &nbsp;ntagato kuba&nbsp; &nbsp;nawe wagiremo ishoramari &nbsp;muri izo kampani(company) inkuru nziza&nbsp; rero ubu tugufiteye amakuru meza&nbsp;ko hari amahirwe kugirango nawe atagucika ; n&#39;uko icyashoboka nawe ubu&nbsp; wakora ishoramamari ryizewe muri&nbsp;imwe&nbsp;kampani(company),&nbsp;ikora ibikorwa bitandukanye &nbsp;bishigiye kuri tekinoroji &nbsp;(technology ) ,&nbsp;ikaba ariyo ifite rumwe mu rubuga rwa hano mu Rwanda&nbsp;rudasanzwe, rushobora kuzasimbura zimwe muri ziriya twavuze &nbsp;haruguru. Nk&#39;uko uzabyibonera mu gihe kigiye kuza,&nbsp;&nbsp;kuko rukoranye&nbsp;ubuhanga budasanzwe, &nbsp;arurwo rubuga rwacu: www.muhahe.com.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ubu uhawe amahirwe &nbsp;adasanzwe yo kuba mu bemerwe gukoramo ishora mari, ukaba umwe&nbsp;banyamigabane barwo ukazabona inyungu zishimishije z&#39;igihe gito ni iz&#39;igihe kirabye, aho mu gihe kizaza &nbsp;kandi nawe uzisanga muba billionaire, ubikesha kureba kure, no gufatanya na Muhahe ltd. ukibera umunyamigabane muri uyu mushinga wikoranabuhanga. &nbsp;Ngaho rero byaza&nbsp;&nbsp;umusaruro ayo mahirwe&nbsp;&nbsp;ubonye, nawe mu minsi iza, &nbsp;ukazisanga ufite akayabo kamafaranga. ubikesha gukora ishoramari muri tekinoroji(technology) ya Muhahe ltd. ifite ridasanzwe. Iki nicyo gihe cyawe nawe cyokugera kubyo utatekerezaga, ubikesha gukora ishoramari mu ikoranabuhanga rigezweho ry&#39;ejo hazaza, kandi&nbsp;&nbsp;ryizewe rwose.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hagarika &nbsp;gukomeza uri umufana uvuga&nbsp; gusa abakire bakijijwe&nbsp;n&#39; ikoranabuhanga nawe ubarirwe mu bashoramari&nbsp; bakoze ishora mari kubucuruzi bwo kuri internet&nbsp; niba witeguye, kumenya uko wakora ishoramari muri uyu mushinga udasanzwe! Watwandikira&nbsp;&nbsp;kuri whatsap+250783524980&nbsp;no &nbsp;kuri email servicemuhahe@gmail.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p>watanga ni ibitekerezo cg ukanabaza murabyemerewe.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1632072409muhahe blog1.jpg', 'Muhahe', 1474, 1, NULL, NULL, 'investment,money,technology', '2021-09-19 12:36:21');
