(145, NULL, 'normal', NULL, 0, 7, NULL, NULL, 'Clip lens for smartphone', 'clip-lens-for-smartphone-rds145ax5', '156691715452THUvvh.png', '1566917154owUTFqSI.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8.774623788005089, 0, '<b><font color=\"#000099\">Description:</font></b><div><span style=\"font-family: \" open=\"\" sans\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 13px;\"=\"\"><font color=\"#000000\">Add Fisheye, Wide-Angle, or Macro capabilities to any smartphone with this compact and extremely portable smartphone camera adaptor kit!</font></span><br></div><div><ol><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: baseline; text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Clip Design Compatible to Attach With iPhone and All Smartphones</font></li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: baseline; text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><font color=\"#000000\">3 In 1 Lens Kit – Fisheye Lens, Wide Angle Lens, and Macro Lens</font></li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: baseline; text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Fisheye lens adapter’s Extremely Wide Angle and Super Short Focal Length. It made out of Multi-coated High Definition Optical Glass</font></li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: baseline; text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Wide Angle Lens uses for Those Occasions When You Need That Extra Field of View, Approximately Two Times of Normal Phone Lens</font></li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: 0px 0px; font-size: 13px; vertical-align: baseline; text-size-adjust: 100%;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Macro Lens uses for Extreme Close-up the Object Magnifies around 10 Times. It Allows the Phon