(157, NULL, 'normal', NULL, 0, 9, NULL, NULL, 'Touch Screen Bluetooth Smart Watch Phone', 'touch-screen-bluetooth-smart-watch-phone-krl157t8l', '1566931416DtJpY54G.png', '1566931416ozB818cQ.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 26.872285350765583, 32.90483920501909, '<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\" class=\"ui-box-body\"><ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\" class=\"product-property-list util-clearfix\"><div style=\"font-family: \" open=\"\" sans\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><div style=\"outline: none; font-family: Poppins; letter-spacing: 0.6px;\"><b style=\"\"><font color=\"#000099\" style=\"\" size=\"5\">Description:</font></b></div></div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: \" open=\"\" sans\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><div style=\"outline: none; font-family: Poppins; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.6px;\"><p class=\"text-lg\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 24, 28); margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 11px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.375; font-family: Lato, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.14px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></p><div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18.4px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Helvetica; vertical-align: baseline; letter-spacing: normal;\"><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">1. Good texture, simple and generous appearance</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\" style=\"text-align: center;\">2.&nbsp;</font><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\">Play music when the cell phone is connected to the smartwatch.</font></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\">3. Synchronize the telephone book of smartphone and Bluetooth function, could make calls and answer the telephone anywhere and anytime</font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\">4. Could connect to android and ios system, good compatibility</font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">5. Touch screen, show incoming caller number</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">6.&nbsp;</span><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\">Compatibility: Support mobile phone with Bluetooth 4.0 &amp; 3.0&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\">7.&nbsp;</font><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\">The altimeter, pedometer, calendar, calculator, profiles, audio player, sounder recorder function.</font></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\">8. Anti-lost. the watch will send an alarm after leaving the mobile phone a certain distance.</font></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\">9. Support SIM TF Card. you can use it as a phone.</font></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">10.&nbsp;Compatibility: All Android Mobile Phone &amp; Android Tablet PC. Android Mobile Phone: Samsung, HTC, Sony, LG, HUAWEI, ZTE, OPPO, XIAOMI, and so on. Some functions are compatible with IOS iPhone 4 / 4S / 5 / 5S / 6 / 6 Plus / 6S / 7 / 8 / X</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-fa